# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FFXIV Mod Organizer — .NET 8 / WPF
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Build output -----------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerated by `dotnet build` / `dotnet publish`; ~430 MB for this solution.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
/publish/
x64/
x86/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.deps.json
*.runtimeconfig.json

# --- Secrets and machine-local configuration --------------------------------
# The app normally keeps these under %LOCALAPPDATA%\FFXIVModOrganizer\, i.e.
# outside the repo. These rules are the safety net for a copy placed next to
# the binaries or in the working tree.
#
#   appsettings.json  Postgres connection string (incl. password) + Supabase anon key
#   token.dat         DPAPI-encrypted Supabase access/refresh tokens
appsettings.json
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.Example.json
token.dat
secrets.json
*.secret
*.secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pfx
*.snk
*.publishsettings

# --- App runtime data -------------------------------------------------------
# Caches and logs the app writes at runtime. Under %LOCALAPPDATA% in normal use,
# but listed so a redirected or portable install never gets committed.
#
# Root-anchored on purpose: an unanchored "archive/" also swallows the source
# folder src/ModOrganizer.Core/Archive/.
/logs/
/thumbs/
/archive/
/comment_assets/

# --- Mod payloads -----------------------------------------------------------
# This repo holds source only. A single .pmp can be hundreds of megabytes, and
# mod archives are never part of the build.
*.pmp
*.ttmp
*.ttmp2

